Z||000014||Fformula88||10-17-2001||10:17 AM||||Get the right one and it does... do a search for 3.4L... there is a TON of stuff on this forum on it.  As long as its the OHV 3.4L... and not any of the aluminum head ones.  Look Camaro/Firebird.  The only hitch as I understand it is you will need to drill holes for the starter on the other side of this bock, but thats not too hard. ||||reg||1
